jx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c37\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mspace style=\"width: 0.167em;\"></mjx-mspace></mjx-mstyle><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"2\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-tstrut></mjx-tstrut></mjx-mtd></mjx-mtr></mjx-itable></mjx-table></mjx-mtable></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"block\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mtable displaystyle=\"true\" columnalign=\"right left\" columnspacing=\"0em\" rowspacing=\"0.8em 0.8em 0.8em 0.8em 0.3em\"><mtr><mtd><mo stretchy=\"false\">|</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi>I</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">|</mo></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"INNER\"><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OPEN\">|</mo><mtable columnalign=\"center\" columnspacing=\"1em\" rowspacing=\"4pt\"><mtr><mtd><mn>9</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>4</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>4</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\">|</mo></mrow></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>16</mn></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msup><mi>λ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>λ</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>70</mn></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>λ</mi></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>,</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mn>10.</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n</li>\n<li><p>Statement II is false, while statement III is true. Since <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"139\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D434 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> has both positive and negative eigenvalues, the quadratic form <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"140\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msup><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D431 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.363em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D447 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-script></mjx-msup><mjx-mstyle style=\"width: 0px; margin-right: -0.167em;\"><mjx-mspace style=\"margin-right: -0.167em;\"></mjx-mspace></mjx-mstyle><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D434 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mspace style=\"width: 0.167em;\"></mjx-mspace></mjx-mstyle><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D431 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi></mrow><mi>T</mi></msup><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"-0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mi>A</mi><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi></mrow></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> (as well as the matrix <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"141\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D434 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>) is indefinite.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Therefore, the correct answer is \"III only.\"</p>\n</div></div>",
